     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet horizontal-deviation-direction-vs</b></p><a name=\"horizontal-deviation-direction-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hchorizontal-deviation-direction-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-fhir4eyes-cs.html\"><code>https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.4.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-fhir4eyes-cs.html#fhir4eyes-cs-esodeviation\">esodeviation</a></td><td>Esodeviation</td><td>Inward (nasal) horizontal deviation of the eye; covers esotropia and esophoria.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-fhir4eyes-cs.html#fhir4eyes-cs-exodeviation\">exodeviation</a></td><td>Exodeviation</td><td>Outward (temporal) horizontal deviation of the eye; covers exotropia and exophoria.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-fhir4eyes-cs.html#fhir4eyes-cs-orthophoria\">orthophoria</a></td><td>Orthophoria</td><td>Absence of any manifest or latent ocular deviation; the visual axes remain aligned under cover testing.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
